# Build context exclusions for deploy/docker/Dockerfile, whose context is the
# repository root (the build needs the whole multi-module tree).
#
# Without this the context is well over a gigabyte: the git history alone is
# ~888 MB, and every module's target/ would be shipped to the daemon only to be
# overwritten by the build.

.git
.github
**/target
**/node_modules

# Never send deployment material or credentials into a build context.
.env
**/*.env
deploy/data-2024
deploy/harvest-records-2024
**/*.war
**/*.mv.db
**/*.docx

# Editor and OS noise
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iml
